# Security Policy

## Supported Versions

This repository is a personal portfolio and contains projects developed for academic, research, and learning purposes.

Security updates will be considered for the current version of the projects maintained in this repository.

| Version        | Supported          |
| -------------- | ------------------ |
| Latest         | :white_check_mark: |
| Older versions | :x:                |

## Reporting a Vulnerability

If you discover a security vulnerability or security-related issue in any project in this repository, please report it responsibly.

Please contact me through:

* **Email:** [aj28juned@gmail.com](mailto:aj28juned@gmail.com)
* **LinkedIn:** linkedin.com/in/muhhamadjunaedi

When reporting an issue, please provide:

1. A brief description of the vulnerability.
2. Steps to reproduce the issue, if applicable.
3. The potential impact of the vulnerability.
4. Any additional information that may help with investigation.

I will review the report and respond as soon as reasonably possible.

Please avoid publicly disclosing the vulnerability before it has been reviewed and addressed.
